    "body": "Batched int4 tensor core kernel should just work out of box.  Batched GEMM is used as the baseline in this example: https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/blob/master/examples/24_gemm_grouped/gemm_grouped.cu#L1275-L1293 .  You should just need to change data types and tile sizes to those used by int4.  \r\n\r\nGroup GEMM is a more power tool than batched gemm because it relaxes many restrictions of batched gemm.  \r\nExample 24 shows how to use group gemm.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
